QuestGuidance.Register("es",27,{
[833]="7005874A\n1\tTake inventory (total: 12)\tSupplies can be found at Zarkul-sulûn. You should take inventory of supplies for Náin the Slakeless.\n2\tReport back to Náin the Slakeless\tNáin the Slakeless can be found at Zarkul-sulûn. You should report back to Náin the Slakeless.\n",
[834]="70028FBF\n1\tRecolecta clavos perdidos (total: 15)\tVarias personas de Galtrev tomaron clavos prestados de Rhianu y es probable que estén esparcidos por el pueblo. Debes recolectar los clavos perdidos y devolvérselos a Rhianu para que pueda terminar su trabajo en la máquina de asedio.\n2\tDevuelve los clavos perdidos a Rhianu\tRhianu se encuentra en el cuarto frente de trabajo de Galtrev. Debes llevarle los clavos que recolectaste para que pueda terminar su trabajo del día.\n",
[835]="70058461\n1\tThe note contains directions to a specific location. Asking the scouts around Annâk-khurfu about this bat may give you some much-needed context.\t\n2\tTalk to Rékkur\tAll of the scouts you talked to about the bat have mentioned Rékkur, a dwarf who may be interested in what you've found. He stands guard in front of Annâk-khurfu.\n3\tGo to the overlook\tThe note describes an overlook west of the path leading up to Zarkul-sulûn, a ruin west of Annâk-khurfu. Rékkur has suggested that you venture to that location to see what's there.\n4\tSearch the body\030Read the note\030Examina las huellas\tThe note has brought you to the body of a dwarf scout near Zarkul-sulûn. You should search the body and the immediate area for clues to what has transpired.\n5\tTalk to Rékkur\tYou have found a new note, as well as possible clues to this scout's death. Rékkur will want to hear about your discoveries back at Annâk-khurfu.\n",
[836]="7005A661\n1\tDefeat frenzied stone-claws (total: 8)\030Collect strange runes (total: 10)\tStrange runes and frenzied stone-claws can both be found in the north-western section of Máttugard. You should collect the strange runes and defeat the frenzied stone-claws that you encounter.\n2\tTalk to Varthmath at Zidir-nesad\tVarthmath can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset, in Máttugard. You should talk to Varthmath at Zidir-nesad.\n3\tGive the strange runes to Voina\tVoina can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset, in Máttugard. You should give the strange runes to Voina.\n4\tTalk to Voina\tVoina can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset, in Máttugard. You should talk to Voina.\n",
[837]="700173D3\n1\tLleva el mensaje a Ornras en Echad Mirobel\030Recoge Strange Missive\tDirígete a las ruinas de Echad Mirobel, situadas en el extremo suroeste de Eregion. El mensaje que has encontrado habla del deseo de Angmar de rastrear las ruinas que quedan en busca de cualquier vestigio de poder o conocimiento que pueda utilizarse para reforzar aún más sus fuerzas en el norte. Menciona que un uruk llamado Gûrsh ha sido puesto al mando de la expedición.\n",
[838]="70035766\n1\tInvoca a Cyneberg a tu lado\tCyneberg te ha dado un silbato para llamarla. Deberías llamar a Cyneberg para que esté a tu lado.\n2\tEl mejor camino se encuentra al suroeste de la cresta de Grimnesberg. Puedes llamar a Cyneberg con el silbato si llegan a separarse. Deberías dirigirte al suroeste con Cyneberg para comenzar el regreso a Forlaw, y hablar con ella cuando esté lista.\t\n3\tSe puede encontrar otro montón de orcos al noroeste del primero, en el este de las Altas Lomas. Deberías investigar a los orcos junto con Cyneberg.\t\n4\tSe puede encontrar otro montón de orcos al norte del primero, en el este de las Altas Lomas. Deberías investigar a los orcos junto con Cyneberg.\t\n5\tEncuentra los cadáveres de orcos al norte\tSe puede encontrar otro montón de orcos al norte del primero, en el este de las Altas Lomas. Deberías investigar a los orcos junto con Cyneberg.\n6\tHabla con Cyneberg\tCyneberg está arrodillada junto a un montón de orcos asesinados en el norte de las Altas Lomas. Deberías hablar con Cyneberg.\n",
[839]="7000A2A5\n1\tPasa tiempo buscando jabalíes en Evendim\tEvendim es un lugar grande. Debería haber jabalíes en algún sitio. Parr Cortacostilla está convencido de que debe haber jabalíes en alguna parte de Evendim y quiere que pases algún tiempo buscando uno.\n2\tHabla con Parr Cortacostilla en Ost Forod\tParr Cortacostilla está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech. No has encontrado ningún rastro de jabalíes en Evendim y deberías informar de tu triste descubrimiento a Parr Cortacostilla.\n",
[840]="70044AB7\n1\tHabla con Bingo al este del centro de Galtrev, en Pren Gwydh\tBingo quiere viajar a Galtrev, en Pren Gwydh. Te encontrará dentro de la ciudad, al este del centro del pueblo.\n2\tHabla con Hunfredo Rebuscón en Galtrev, en las Tierras Brunas\tHunfredo Rebuscón está al este del centro de Galtrev, en las Tierras Brunas.\n3\tVe al lugar descrito en el acertijo de Hunfredo para encontrar a Teodoro y Haley\tHunfredo Rebuscón te ha dado un acertijo que debes resolver. Debería indicarte el destino al que se dirigían Haley Pradodulce y Teodoro Tojo.\n4\tHabla con Haley Pradodulce en Avardin\tHaley Pradodulce está en la ciudad de Avardin, en las Tierras Brunas.\n5\tHabla con Teodoro Tojo en Avardin\tTeodoro Tojo está en la ciudad de Avardin, en las Tierras Brunas.\n6\tHabla con Teodoro Tojo en Avardin... otra vez\tTeodoro Tojo está en la ciudad de Avardin, en las Tierras Brunas.\n7\tHabla con Teodoro Tojo en Avardin... otra vez\tTeodoro Tojo está en la ciudad de Avardin, en las Tierras Brunas.\n8\tHabla con Teodoro Tojo en Avardin... otra vez\tTeodoro Tojo está en la ciudad de Avardin, en las Tierras Brunas.\n9\tHabla con Teodoro Tojo en Avardin... otra vez\tTeodoro Tojo está en la ciudad de Avardin, en las Tierras Brunas.\n10\tHabla con Haley Pradodulce en Avardin\tHaley Pradodulce está en la ciudad de Avardin, en las Tierras Brunas.\n11\tHabla con Bingo en Avardin, en las Tierras Brunas\tBingo está en la ciudad de Avardin, en las Tierras Brunas.\n",
[841]="70022761\n1\tRecoge pruebas de que llegaste al ático\030Recoge pruebas de que llegaste al sótano\030Recoge pruebas de que llegaste al Ala Rastrera\030Recoge pruebas de que llegaste al Ala Telarañosa\tUna prueba de tu visita a cada rincón del Agujero Embrujado se encuentra en cada uno de los niveles fuera del piso principal. Debes recoger pruebas de que has visitado las cuatro áreas principales del Agujero Embrujado y regresar antes de que se acabe el tiempo\n2\tRegresa con Poppy Coto con la prueba de tu expedición\tPoppy Coto está fuera del Agujero Embrujado, junto al Árbol de la Fiesta. Debes regresar rápidamente a Poppy Coto con la prueba de que caminaste valiente y hábilmente en sus pasos dentro del Agujero Embrujado.\n",
[842]="70044470\n1\tTalk to Bergil\tBergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back. See where Bergil wishes to go first.\n2\tGo see the ranks of soldiers\tGo to see the ranks of soldiers before the City Gates. Bergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\n3\tTalk to Bergil\tBergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back. See where Bergil wishes to go next.\n4\tGo see the ranks of soldiers\tGo to see another rank of soldiers before the City Gates. Bergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\n5\tTalk to Bergil\tBergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back. See where Bergil wishes to go next.\n6\tGo see the other soldiers\tRanks of soldiers can be found near the City Gates. Take Bergil to see more ranks of soldiers.\n7\tTalk to Rossaran\tRossaran the Swan-knight stands near the rude soldiers, inside the main gates of Minas Tirith. A swan-knight took note of the soldiers who were rude to Bergil, and seems to want to speak with you.\n8\tTalk to Bergil\tBergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back. See where Bergil wishes to go next.\n9\tEnter the City Stables\030Take some apples\tThe City Stables stand across from the gates. Bergil wishes to feed some apples the horses in the City Stables. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\n10\tThe City Stables stand across from the gates. Bergil wishes to feed some apples the horses in the City Stables. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\t\n11\tThe horses have devoured the apples.\t\n12\tTalk to Bergil\tBergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back. See where Bergil wishes to go next.\n13\tAsk Himnir for treats\tThe Foodmongers' Market lies in the northern stretch of the First Circle. Help Bergil find the foodmonger Himnir and ask for a treat for all the children. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\n14\tHabla con Amonel\tThe Wrights' Market lies in the southern stretch of the First Circle. Bring the broken whisk to the tinker Amonel in the Wrights' Market, as Himnir asked. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\n15\tTalk to Bergil\tBergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back. See what Bergil wishes to while you wait for the tinker to mend the whisk.\n16\tTour the southern wall\030Look out from over the City Gates\030Tour the northern wall\030Tour the far northern wall\tThe city walls can be reached via stairs from several points throughout the First Circle of Minas Tirith. Stroll with Bergil up upon the outer walls of Minas Tirith. If you should get separated, the whistle Bergil gave you will call him back.\n17\tTalk to Oryat\tWhile touring the city walls with Bergil, you have crossed paths with Oryat, the soldier who berated Bergil earlier. You should intervene before he lays his hands on the boy.\n18\tTalk to Bergil\tYou intervened to keep Oryat from striking Bergil, and Oryat challenged you to what is surely an ill-advised duel. See where Bergil wishes to go now. If you should get separated, the whistle Bergil gave you will call him back.\n19\tReturn to Amonel the tinker\tAmonel is in the Wrights' Fellow-hall, in the southern stretch of the First Circle. Return to the tinker Amonel, to see if Himnir's whisk has been mended. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\n20\tHabla con Bergil\tBergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back. See where Bergil wishes to go next.\n21\tMeet Oryat\tOryat will be waiting in the Second Circle, between the Feasting Hall and the tavern. Bergil has implored you to go and fight Oryat, to teach him a lesson. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\n22\tDefeat Oryat\tOryat stands in the Second Circle, between the Feasting Hall and the tavern. Bergil has implored you to go and fight Oryat, to teach him a lesson. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\n23\tTalk to Rossaran\tRossaran stands in the Second Circle, across from the Feasting Hall. After facing down the bully Oryat, you noticed the Swan-knight Rossaran standing nearby. See what he has to say. If you should get separated from Bergil, the whistle he gave you will call him back.\n24\tTalk to Bergil\tBergil will accompany you on the stroll. If you should get separated, the whistle he gave you will call him back. See what Bergil has to say.\n25\tMeet Bergil back at the Old Guest-house\tThe Old Guest-house lies in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates. You have beaten Oryat and scared him from troubling the children in the First Circle... but he has threatened harm to any who trespass in the Second Circle. Meet Bergil back at the Old Guest-house, where he stays.\n",
[843]="7005F869\n1\tTalk to Spall at Watchers' Roost\tSpall can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn. Hermáth Stormhammer has permitted Spall to conduct a survey of Gloomingtarn on the condition that you accompany him. You should talk to Spall.\n2\tTalk to Vithin and assist the expedition in Glittengrof\030Talk to Lokur and assist the expedition in Ormgren\030Aid Spall with 'Surveying Glittengrof'\030Aid Spall with 'Surveying Ormgren'\tVithin and Lokur can be found in Glittengrof and Ormgren, respectively. Spall can be found at your side. Hermáth Stormhammer has permitted Spall to conduct a survey of Gloomingtarn on the condition that you accompany him and also aid the expeditions in Glittengrof and Ormgren. You should aid Spall with his survey and receive reports from Lokur and Vithin, two warriors of Hermáth Stormhammer's expedition. NOTE: If you become separated from Spall, use the horn he gave you to call him to your side.\n3\tTalk to Spall\tSpall can be found at your side in Gloomingtarn. You have helped Spall complete his survey of Glittengrof and Ormgren. You should talk to Spall. NOTE: If you become separated from Spall, use the horn he gave you to call him to your side.\n4\tTalk to Hermáth Stormhammer at Watchers' Roost\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn. You have assisted Lokur and Vithin with their expeditions into Glittengrof and Ormgren, and Spall has completed the first part of his survey of Gloomingtarn. You should return to Watchers' Roost and talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.\n",
[844]="7005B22B\n1\tTalk to Múta outside of Gazat-fark\tMúta can be found outside Gazat-fark, located on the lowest level of Deepscrave and to the south-east of Aslíf.\n2\tFour dwarf smiths are being held at Gazat-fark. One has been spotted on the ground level, and the other on the second floor. The others may be trapped in Durbángh -- behind the doors on the second floor.\t\n3\tReturn to Náin in Aslíf\tYou have rescued the dwarf smiths. You should return to Náin in Aslíf on the upper tier.\n4\tTalk to Féli\tYou have returned to Aslíf and should talk to Féli.\n5\tTalk to Shúkurz\tYou should talk to Shúkurz and see what he has to say.\n",
[845]="700379F8\n1\tDefeat Half-orcs at Fushum Raus (total: 10)\tHalf-orcs can be found in their encampment south-east from the gates of Grimslade. You should defeat Half-orcs at Fushum Raus.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have defeated a number of Half-orcs near Grimslade, but there are too many to uproot the entire encampment. You have done all that you could here.\n",
[846]="7002F97D\n1\tHabla con el reeve Athelward en el salón del hidromiel de Cliving\tEl Reeve Athelward reside en su sala del hidromiel, en el extremo este de Cliving. Ides te ha pedido que regreses a Cliving para agradecer a su padre por su apoyo y para que ella pueda continuar con su entrenamiento sin tu mentoría.\n2\tHabla con el Thane Elfmar en el salón del hidromiel de Redilaldea\tEl Thane Elfmar reside en el salón del hidromiel de Redilaldea, la ciudad más al sur de las Campiñas del Norte. Athelward desea que entregues un mensaje: que los jinetes de Elfmar deben presentarse en la ciudad de Cliving para servir al Reeve.\n",
[847]="70026E57\n1\tEnvía convocatorias por craban (total: 6)\tLos cuervos pueden encontrarse por todo el pueblo de Lhan Tarren. Debes enviar una convocatoria a cada una de las seis familias de granjeros y pastores de Fuerte Dreng.\n2\tHabla con el Anciano en Lhan Tarren\tEl Anciano está en Lhan Tarren, el pueblo del Clan del Ciervo en Fuerte Dreng. Debes hablar con el Anciano ahora que has soltado a los cuervos para que entreguen sus convocatorias a los granjeros lejanos.\n",
[848]="70038600\n1\tTalk to Thane Mágla in Middlemead\tThane Mágla can be found in the Mead Hall of Middlemead in north-western Kingstead. Éowyn, acting as steward of Edoras, has asked you to aid in gathering the people of Middlemead in preparation for the journey to Dunharrow.\n",
[849]="7004E147\n1\tParticipa en las actividades de la Feria de los Granjeros (total: 10)\tCada día hay algo que hacer para el Festival de la Feria Agrícola. ¡Ven y únete a todos para celebrar otro año maravilloso y participa en las muchas actividades del Festival!\n2\tHabla con Campanula Redondo\tCampanula Redondo quiere agradecerte por tu participación de hoy en la Feria Agrícola.\n",
[850]="7002BFFF\n1\tHabla con Céola cuando lo tengas todo listo para atacar Lashkarg\tCéola está en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas. Cuando lo tengas todo listo para comenzar el ataque a Lashkarg, debes hablar con Céola. NOTA: Esta misión de instancia debe jugarse en solitario, por lo que no puede ser llevada a cabo en grupo.\n2\tHabla con Céola en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas\tCéola está en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas. Deberías volver a ver a Céola con la noticia de tu victoria.\n",
[851]="7002C625\n1\tHabla con Céola cuando lo tengas todo listo para atacar Lashkarg\tCéola está en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas. Deberías hablar con Céola cuando lo tengas todo preparado para partir a Lashkarg.NOTA: Esta misión de instancia debe jugarse en solitario, por lo que no puede ser llevada a cabo en grupo.\n2\tHabla con Céola en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas\tCéola está en Etheburg, en las Tierras Pardas. Deberías volver a ver a Céola con las noticias de tu victoria en Lashkarg.\n",
[852]="70007D99\n1\tLleva la piel de lince a un armero élfico para que confeccione una capa\tLos Elfos habitan en el valle oculto de Rivendel, en los límites orientales del Bosque de los Trolls. Atacado por el Lince del Páramo Alto, venciste a la bestia y descubriste que tus golpes no dejaron marca alguna en su piel. Tras retirar la piel con destreza, deberías buscar a un armero de armaduras ligeras que pudiera convertirla en una capa magnífica.\n",
[853]="70062D7A\n1\tDestruir alijos de armas de orcos (total: 10)\tMelia te ha pedido que destruyas alijos de armas de orcos en Tharbad. Tharbad está en el sur de Cardolan.\n2\tVolver a Melia\tDeberías hacerle saber a Melia que has llevado a cabo su venganza contra los orcos. Melia está en el Campamento de Siempreviva, al noreste de Tharbad.\n",
[854]="7006EBC6\n1\tDerrota a los soldados de Ekhamâti (total: 12)\030Roba los depósitos de armas (total: 8)\tTu misión es robar armas de un campamento de Ekhamâti cercano y derrotar a tantos soldados como puedas. Debes salir antes de que lleguen los refuerzos.\n2\tEscapa del campamento antes de que lleguen los refuerzos\t¡Regresa a la entrada y escapa del campamento antes de que lleguen los refuerzos! Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n3\tDerrota al dôlo de Ekhamâti\t¡Derrota al dôlo de Ekhamâti!\n",
[855]="7005AAF7\n1\tDefeat wandering fell spirits (total: 8)\tYou discovered fell spirits hidden in the forest near Mullach Cagar. You should find and defeat the wandering fell spirits.\n2\tTalk to Molkha in the valley\tYou found and defeated many fell spirits near Mullach Cagar. You should report this to Molkha in the valley.\n",
[856]="70066EE8\n1\tTalk to the supplier in south-west Tadrent\tA supplier sells goods in the south-west corner of Tadrent, in King's Gondor.\n2\tBring the shiny golden needle to Little Pip in Tadrent, King's Gondor\tLittle Pip is by the haystack in question near the northern entrance to Tadrent, in King's Gondor.\n3\tBring the shiny golden needle to Vexed Meldis in Tadrent, King's Gondor\tVexed Meldis stands by her home in western Tadrent, King's Gondor.\n4\tWait for her response\tVexed Meldis stands in shock.\n5\tTalk to Little Pip by the haystack in Tadrent, King's Gondor\tLittle Pip is by the northern entrance of Tadrent, in King's Gondor.\n",
[857]="7000B95A\n1\tLleva el guiso de sapo mejorado a Indor\tIndor está en la hoguera de Echad Candelleth, en Tâl Bruinen. Wéthorm te ha devuelto el guiso de sapo y te ha pedido que transmitas sus felicitaciones a Indor por la mejora.\n",
[858]="7002BFB0\n1\tDerrota insectos (total: 8)\tLos insectos pueden encontrarse en el nido, al nordeste del campamento de los Hombres del Bosque en Juncal. Gisalic te ha pedido que derrotes a muchos de los insectos que has descubierto en Juncal.\n2\tHabla con Gisalic en el campamento de los Hombres del Bosque, en el corazón de Juncal.\tGisalic está en el campamento de los Hombres del Bosque, en Juncal, al suroeste del nido de insectos. Debes regresar con Gisalic para informarle de tu éxito.\n",
[859]="7000E5EE\n1\tConsigue para Déornyd una nueva espada de un Gauradan\tLos Gauradan merodean al norte y al oeste de Pynti-peldot, cerca de las Piedras Solitarias. Déornyd te ha pedido que sustituyas su espada rota por otra robada a uno de los Gauradan.\n2\tConsigue para Déornyd una nueva espada de un Gauradan\tLos Gauradan merodean al norte y al oeste de Pynti-peldot, cerca de las Piedras Solitarias. Déornyd te ha pedido que sustituyas su espada rota por otra robada a uno de los Gauradan.\n3\tLleva la espada de los Gauradan a Déornyd en Pynti-peldot\tDéornyd se encuentra en Pynti-peldot, al sureste de donde merodean los Gauradan. Deberías llevarle a Déornyd la espada de los Gauradan.\n",
[860]="7002CBE2\n1\tHabla con Idmar\tIdmar está en su campamento junto al camino, en el centro de Parth Celebrant. Debes llevar el símbolo que encontraste a Idmar.\n2\tHabla con Doron\tDoron está entre sus hombres, en lo alto de la colina del oeste de Parth Celebrant. Idmar sugiere que Doron podría saber algo sobre el símbolo que encontraste.\n",
[861]="70007034\n1\tRecolecta guede de las colinas (total: 4)\030Recolecta orcanete de las colinas (total: 4)\tLa guede de las colinas y el orcanete de las colinas crecen en las colinas del este de Nan Amlug y Rhunenlad. Elúr te ha pedido que recolectes guede de las colinas y orcanete de las colinas para Esteldín.\n2\tLleva las plantas tintóreas a Nethúr en Esteldín\tEl orcanete y la guede que recolectaste pueden entregarse a Nethúr en Esteldín.\n",
[862]="70021595\n1\tLleva el fragmento de amuleto a Mincham, en los los Acantilados del Liche\tMincham tiene su campamento al este del camino, junto al límite septentrional de los los Acantilados del Liche. Deberías llevar este fragmento de amuleto al montaraz Mincham.\n",
[863]="7006F092\n1\tReach the mouth of the river\tTalmûri has asked for your help investigating claims of a poisoned water source in the area. Travel north-west to the mouth of the river to see if you can find any clues as to the cause of the tainted water.\n2\tInvestigate tracks (total: 2)\tYou arrived at the mouth of the river Talmûri told you about. Investigate the area and see if you can find any clues as to what may be causing the water to be poisoned.\n3\tYou arrived at the mouth of the river Talmûri told you about. Investigate the area and see if you can find any clues as to what may be causing the water to be poisoned.\t\n4\tSearch further up the river\tYou found tracks near the mouth of the river Talmûri told you about. They pointed further upstream. Follow the river to see if you can find any more indications of the poison's source.\n5\tInvestigate tracks (total: 3)\tYou found more tracks along the river. Investigate them to see what you can learn.\n6\tYou found more tracks along the river. Investigate them to see what you can learn.\t\n7\tContinue your search up the river\tYou found more tracks that point even further upstream. You have to be getting close now. Follow the river to find the source of the poison.\n8\tRemove animal carcasses (total: 2)\tYou discovered the source of the poisoned water to be rotting animal carcasses. Remove them to stop river's water from being tainted.\n9\tReturn to Talmûri in Burukíri\tReturn to Talmûri in Burukíri and let her know it wasn't Ekhamâti soldiers poisoning the river, it was only animal carcasses that began to rot in the water.\n",
[864]="7006C6E6\n1\tDefeat Ordâkhai warriors at Omboha ([según el diario]/12)\030Defeat Dhómok Umûn\030Recover Raphuz's father's sword\tRaphûz directed you to an Ordâkhai camp north-east of Iridír. He believes that Dhómok Umûn, the warlord who stole his father's sword and arm, is there. In addition, you can help the people of Ambarûl by thinning out the Ordâkhai.\n2\tDeliver the sword to Raphûz at Iridír\tYou found Dhómok Umûn and defeated him, recovering Raphûz's father's sword. Return the sword to Raphûz at the settlement of Iridír.\n",
})
